WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.700
One picture. Two players.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.800
Guesser’s side — picture hidden.

3
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.600
Give a clue: "It keeps you dry."

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.600
Guess: "An umbrella!"

5
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.600
Press to mark correct.

6
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.800
Skip to the next picture.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.400
Give a clue: "It shines in the sky."

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.700
Guess: "The sun!"

9
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.800
Players judge, then press.

10
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.000
Swap roles. Keep playing.
